        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content_en": "The Chinese training program is credit-bearing and free for international students. The CCU Chinese Language Center provides instruction using multimedia activities and learning games to develop language ability and understanding of local culture. Students are encouraged to take at least one Chinese course during their stay at CCU.",
            "content_zh": "中文訓練課程為國際學生可修習的學分課程，且免收課程費用。中正大學華語中心透過多媒體活動與學習遊戲提供華語教學，協助學生培養語言能力並了解在地文化。學校鼓勵國際學生在校期間至少修習一門中文課程。"
          },
